graph TD
    INPUT[Hospitality Inputs] --> MET[HospitalityMetrics]
    MET --> SCORE[HospitalityScoreEngine]
    SCORE --> PILLAR[Pillars: Occupancy / Demand-RevPAR / Growth / Profitability / EarningsQuality / CapitalRisk]
    PILLAR --> COMP[Composite Score]
    COMP --> DEC[HospitalityDecision]
    DEC --> VERDICT[Verdict + Overrides]
    DEC --> EVID[HospitalityEvidence]
    EVID --> SNAP[Snapshot + Replay]
    COMP --> ONTO[Ontology Registration]
    ONTO --> CSIP[CSIP / Portfolio Intelligence]
